 ### [Overall Training Pipeline](13114-overall-training-pipeline.md)
-This article describes the complete training loop for Unconstrained Pose-Prior-Free Neural Radiance Fields (UP-NeRF), which jointly optimizes camera poses, scene geometry, and appearance from unordered, unposed image collections. It integrates a coarse-to-fine hierarchical sampling strategy with a dynamic loss weighting scheme that transitions from feature/depth supervision to RGB reconstruction as training progresses. Unlike standard NeRF pipelines, this method explicitly handles transient artifacts and mirror-symmetry ambiguities through detached network heads and specific scheduling parameters. See [Overall Training Pipeline](13114-overall-training-pipeline.md).
